* [C++ Else] (https://www.w3schools.com/cpp/cpp_conditions_else.asp)
* [C++ For Loop] (https://www.w3schools.com/cpp/cpp_for_loop.asp)
* [C++ Functions] (https://www.w3schools.com/cpp/cpp_functions.asp)
